msgid "# Encoder Cache CPU Offload"
msgstr "# 编码器缓存 CPU 卸载"

msgid ""
"`ECCPUConnector` stores multimodal encoder outputs in a shared CPU mmap. A\n"
"repeated image, audio item, or other multimodal input can be restored from CPU\n"
"memory instead of running the encoder again."
msgstr ""
"`ECCPUConnector` 将多模态编码器输出存储在共享的 CPU mmap 中。对于重复的图片、音频项或其他多模态输入，可以直接从 CPU "
"内存中恢复，而无需再次运行编码器。"

msgid "## Support scope"
msgstr "## 支持范围"

msgid ""
"- vLLM Model Runner V2\n"
"- An Ascend device with a CANN build that provides both `aclrtMemcpyBatchAsync` and\n"
"  `aclrtHostRegisterV2(..., ACL_HOST_REG_PINNED)`\n"
"- Linux kernel newer than 5.10, as required by CANN when converting an mmap\n"
"  allocation into page-locked Host memory\n"
"- A single host using `/dev/shm`\n"
"- `ec_both` role"
msgstr ""
"- vLLM Model Runner V2\n"
"- 一个昇腾设备，其 CANN 版本需同时提供 `aclrtMemcpyBatchAsync` 和\n"
"  `aclrtHostRegisterV2(..., ACL_HOST_REG_PINNED)`\n"
"- Linux 内核版本高于 5.10，这是 CANN 将 mmap 分配转换为页锁定 Host 内存时的要求\n"
"- 使用 `/dev/shm` 的单主机\n"
"- `ec_both` 角色"

msgid ""
"Cross-node encoder-cache transfer and NIXL/P2P transfer are not supported by\n"
"this connector."
msgstr "此连接器不支持跨节点编码器缓存传输以及 NIXL/P2P 传输。"

msgid ""
"The Ascend worker registers its shared mmap as real page-locked Host memory.\n"
"If pinned mmap registration or batch memcpy is unavailable, initialization\n"
"fails with an explicit error. It does not silently use pageable memory or the\n"
"per-copy `aclrtMemcpyAsync` fallback."
msgstr ""
"昇腾 worker 将其共享 mmap 注册为真正的页锁定 Host 内存。如果固定 mmap 注册或批量 memcpy "
"不可用，初始化会以明确的错误失败。它不会静默地使用可分页内存或逐次拷贝的 `aclrtMemcpyAsync` 回退方案。"

msgid "## Configuration"
msgstr "## 配置"

msgid "The following example allocates 1 GiB for encoder-cache entries:"
msgstr "以下示例为编码器缓存条目分配 1 GiB："

msgid ""
"`ec_cpu_bytes` must be a positive integer large enough for at least one\n"
"encoder-cache block. The corresponding mmap is created under `/dev/shm`, so\n"
"the host must also have enough tmpfs capacity. Tensor-parallel workers map the\n"
"same file; each worker process registers its own virtual mapping with CANN."
msgstr ""
"`ec_cpu_bytes` 必须是一个正整数，且足够容纳至少一个编码器缓存块。相应的 mmap 创建在 `/dev/shm` "
"下，因此主机还必须具有足够的 tmpfs 容量。张量并行 worker 映射同一个文件；每个 worker 进程向 CANN 注册自己的虚拟映射。"

msgid "## Transfer behavior"
msgstr "## 传输行为"

msgid ""
"On a cache miss, the encoder output is copied from NPU to the pinned mmap with\n"
"one batched D2H operation. On a hit, the blocks are copied back with one\n"
"batched H2D operation. Only TP rank 0 and PCP rank 0 write duplicate encoder\n"
"outputs, while every consumer worker can load its local NPU tensor."
msgstr ""
"在缓存未命中时，编码器输出通过一次批量 D2H 操作从 NPU 拷贝到固定的 mmap。在缓存命中时，这些块通过一次批量 H2D 操作拷贝回来。只有 "
"TP rank 0 和 PCP rank 0 写入重复的编码器输出，而每个消费者 worker 都可以加载其本地的 NPU 张量。"

msgid ""
"The encoder output and D2H save are submitted to the current compute stream,\n"
"so normal stream ordering guarantees that the encoder output is ready before\n"
"the copy starts. Loads use a dedicated stream, and the current compute stream\n"
"waits for that load stream before the restored tensor is consumed."
msgstr ""
"编码器输出和 D2H "
"保存被提交到当前计算流，因此正常的流顺序保证了在拷贝开始之前编码器输出已准备就绪。加载使用专用流，当前计算流在消费恢复的张量之前会等待该加载流。"

msgid ""
"During shutdown, the NPU device is synchronized before the Host mmap is\n"
"unregistered from CANN, closed, and removed. If device synchronization fails,\n"
"the mapping is deliberately left intact for process-exit cleanup rather than\n"
"being unmapped while an asynchronous DMA may still reference it."
msgstr ""
"在关闭期间，会先同步 NPU 设备，然后再从 CANN 注销 Host "
"mmap、关闭并移除它。如果设备同步失败，该映射会被有意保留，交由进程退出时清理，而不是在异步 DMA 可能仍引用它时将其解除映射。"
